<title>USA: Furon Co extends offer for Medex Inc shares.</title>
<headline>Furon Co extends offer for Medex Inc shares.</headline>
<dateline>LAGUNA NIGUEL, Calif. 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Furon Co said it extended its tender offer for any and all of the outstanding common shares, including associated common share purchase rights, of Medex Inc until 5 p.m., New York City time, Thursday, Dec. 19, 1996, unless the tender offer is further extended.</p>
<p>The tender offer was originally scheduled to expire at midnight, New York City time, Monday, Dec. 16, 1996. All other terms and conditions of the tender offer remain unchanged, Furon said.</p>
</text>
